  "limitations": [
    "The study focused on a single classroom environment, and combined effects of lighting and classroom design might have influenced the results. Replication in other classrooms is needed.",
    "The study did not examine variations in results when lighting variables other than ILL and CCT were modified.",
    "The study did not control for time-of-day variations, which could influence results given the wide range of class schedules.",
    "Due to parameterization complications, no control was exercised over the presence of other students or variations in participant viewpoint locations within the classroom/IVE.",
    "Participants' familiarity with IVEs (often linked to gaming) might have led them to focus more on enjoyment than task performance, suggesting a need for protocols to ensure task focus in IVE research."
  ],
